    defaultReply:
      english: Cool! Nice talking to you.
      korean: "\uC88B\uB124\uC694! \uC598\uAE30\uD574\uC11C \uC990\uAC70\uC6E0\uC5B4\uC694."
    exampleSentence: What do you study?
  - npcCode: TOWN_EVENING_WALKER
    npcName: Maya
    roleLabel: "\uD589\uC778"
    opening:
      english: Hi, I'm Maya. I'm just walking home from work.
      korean: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694, \uC800\uB294 Maya\uC608\uC694. \uD1F4\uADFC\uD558\uACE0
        \uC9D1\uC5D0 \uAC78\uC5B4\uAC00\uB294 \uC911\uC774\uC5D0\uC694."
    guidedTurns: []
    keywordReplies:
    - keywords:
      - work
      reply:
        english: I work at an office. It was a long day.
        korean: "\uC0AC\uBB34\uC2E4\uC5D0\uC11C \uC77C\uD574\uC694. \uAE34 \uD558\uB8E8\uC600\uC5B4\uC694."
    - keywords:
      - walk
      reply:
        english: A walk in the evening helps me relax.
        korean: "\uC800\uB141\uC5D0 \uAC78\uC73C\uBA74 \uB9C8\uC74C\uC774 \uD3B8\uD574\uC838\uC694."
    defaultReply:
      english: Have a nice evening!
      korean: "\uC88B\uC740 \uC800\uB141 \uBCF4\uB0B4\uC138\uC694!"
    exampleSentence: How was your day at work?
  - npcCode: TOWN_SHOPPER
    npcName: Helen
    roleLabel: "\uD589\uC778"
    opening:
      english: Hello! I'm Helen. I'm doing my errands today.
      korean: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694! \uC800\uB294 Helen\uC774\uC5D0\uC694.
        \uC624\uB298 \uBCFC\uC77C\uC744 \uBCF4\uB7EC \uB2E4\uB140\uC694."
    guidedTurns: []
    keywordReplies:
    - keywords:
