      reply:
        english: I just bought fresh bread at the bakery.
        korean: "\uBE75\uC9D1\uC5D0\uC11C \uAC13 \uAD6C\uC6B4 \uBE75\uC744 \uC0C0\uC5B4\uC694."
    - keywords:
      - next
      reply:
        english: Next, I need to mail a letter at the post office.
        korean: "\uB2E4\uC74C\uC5D4 \uC6B0\uCCB4\uAD6D\uC5D0\uC11C \uD3B8\uC9C0\uB97C
          \uBD80\uCCD0\uC57C \uD574\uC694."
    defaultReply:
      english: Well, I'd better keep going!
      korean: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uC800\uB294 \uACC4\uC18D \uAC00 \uBCFC\uAC8C\uC694!"
    exampleSentence: Where are you going next?
  - npcCode: TOWN_HANDYMAN
    npcName: Frank
    roleLabel: "\uD589\uC778"
    opening:
      english: Morning! I'm Frank. I fix things around town.
      korean: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694! \uC800\uB294 Frank\uC608\uC694. \uB9C8\uC744
        \uC774\uACF3\uC800\uACF3\uC744 \uACE0\uCCD0\uC694."
    guidedTurns: []
    keywordReplies:
    - keywords:
      - fix
      reply:
        english: Sure, I can fix that. What's broken?
        korean: "\uADF8\uB7FC\uC694, \uACE0\uCCD0 \uB4DC\uB9B4 \uC218 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694.
          \uBB50\uAC00 \uACE0\uC7A5 \uB0AC\uB098\uC694?"
    - keywords:
      - tool
      reply:
        english: I always carry my toolbox.
        korean: "\uC800\uB294 \uB298 \uACF5\uAD6C\uD568\uC744 \uB4E4\uACE0 \uB2E4\uB140\uC694."
    defaultReply:
      english: Just call me if you need a hand.
      korean: "\uB3C4\uC6C0\uC774 \uD544\uC694\uD558\uBA74 \uBD88\uB7EC\uC694."
