      reply:
        english: It's my day off, so I'm enjoying the town.
        korean: "\uC624\uB298 \uC26C\uB294 \uB0A0\uC774\uB77C \uB9C8\uC744\uC744
          \uC990\uAE30\uACE0 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694."
    - keywords:
      - station
      reply:
        english: The fire station isn't open yet, but it will be soon.
        korean: "\uC18C\uBC29\uC11C\uB294 \uC544\uC9C1 \uC548 \uC5F4\uC5C8\uC9C0\uB9CC
