  - npcCode: FIRE_ROOKIE
    npcName: Andre
    roleLabel: "\uC2E0\uC785 \uC18C\uBC29\uAD00"
    opening:
      english: Hey! I'm Andre. I just became a firefighter.
      korean: "\uC548\uB155\uD558\uC138\uC694! \uC800\uB294 Andre\uC608\uC694. \uC5BC\uB9C8
