      reply:
        english: Yes, I'm new. I'm still learning a lot.
        korean: "\uB124, \uC2E0\uC785\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. \uC544\uC9C1 \uBC30\uC6B8
          \uAC8C \uB9CE\uC544\uC694."
    - keywords:
      - station
      reply:
        english: I can't wait for the new fire station to open.
        korean: "\uC0C8 \uC18C\uBC29\uC11C\uAC00 \uBE68\uB9AC \uC5F4\uC5C8\uC73C\uBA74
          \uC88B\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694."
    defaultReply:
      english: Cool! See you around.
      korean: "\uC88B\uC544\uC694! \uB610 \uBD10\uC694."
