      reply:
        english: Good weather for a walk.
        korean: "\uAC77\uAE30 \uC88B\uC740 \uB0A0\uC528\uB124\uC694."
    - keywords:
      - train
      reply:
        english: I worked on the trains for forty years.
        korean: "40\uB144 \uB3D9\uC548 \uAE30\uCC28\uC5D0\uC11C \uC77C\uD588\uC5B4\uC694."
